{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50949","headline":"阅田禾 · 吕从庆","name":"阅田禾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"村南村北稻花明，碧影清光夹望平。\n节弄暑风轻拂拂，尖悬晚露澹盈盈。\n道傍妪妇呼鷄返，坡外儿童跨犊行。\n独坐小桥幽兴满，蟪蛄声在柳梢鸣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕从庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}